$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM 1-{2,4-Bis(benzyloxy)-6-(tert-butyldiphenylsilyloxy)-3-[(2S,3R,4R,5R)-3,4,5-tris(benzyloxy)-6-(benzyloxymethyl)tetrahydro-2H-pyran-2-yl]pheny}ethanone
(5a) To a solution of 5A (1.1 g, 1.03 mmol) and PPh3 (810 mg, 3.1 mmol)
in THF (30 mL) was added benzyl alcohol (320 μL, 3.1 mmol) and DEAD (1.3
mL, 3.1 mmol) at 0 °C, and the reaction mixture was stirred at room
temperature for 3 h. Then, the reaction mixture was concentrated under
reduced pressure. The residue was purified by silica gel column
chromatography (n-hexane/EtOAc = 12/1) to afford 5a (1.1 g, 94%) as a
colorless oil.
1-{2,4-Bis(benzyloxy)-6-(tert-butyldiphenylsilyloxy)-3-[(2S,3R,4R,5R)-3,4,5-tris(benzyloxy)-6-(benzyloxymethyl)tetrahydro-2H-pyran-2-yl]pheny}ethanone
(5a), yield 1.1 g, 94% [α]22 D -26.2 (c 1.10, CHCl3); 1H NMR (500 MHz,
CDCl3): δ 1.08 (s, 9H, TBDPS), 2.59 (s, 3H, Ac), 3.40 (t, 1H, J = 6.0 Hz,
sugar H-4), 3.60 (t, 1H, J = 6.0 Hz, sugar H-3), 3.68 (d, 1H, J = 6.0 Hz,
sugar H-6), 3.72 (td, 1H, J = 6.0, 11.0 Hz, sugar H-5), 4.27 (t, 1H, J =
6.0 Hz, sugar H-2), 4.72 (t, 1H, J = 6.0 Hz, sugar H-1), 3.98-4.94 (m,
12H, Bn), 5.85 (s, 1H, Ar), 6.85-7.73 (m, 40H, Ar); 13C NMR (125 MHz,
CDCl3): δ 32.9 (Ac), 69.2-75.3 (Bn), 70.0 (sugar C-5), 74.3 (sugar C-1),
78.2 (sugar C-6), 79.1 (sugar C-2), 79.5 (sugar C-4), 87.5 (sugar C-3),
101.8 (Ar), 113.7 (Ar), 121.8 (Ar), 126.6-139.0 (Bn, TBDPS), 153.3 (Ar),
156.5 (Ar), 159.4 (Ar), 202.0 (Ar); IR (film, cm-1) 3030, 2929, 2858,
1703, 1598, 1028, 910, 822; HRMS(FAB) m/z calcd for C72H72SiO9Na (M+Na)+
1131.4843, found 1131.4860.
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):NOTES
