afford, after concentration of the appropriate fractions. Compound 26
(1.10 g, 89%) as a clear, colorless oil. [α]20 D -89.5 (c 1.2, CHCl3); 1H
NMR (400 MHz, CDCl3) δ 7.40 (d, J = 8.3 Hz, 2H), 7.37 (m, 1H), 7.22 (m,
1H), 6.94-6.89 (complex m, 4H), 6.04 (t, J = 3.2 Hz, 1H), 4.93 (ddd, J =
7.4, 3.2, and 1.5 Hz, 1H), 4.89 (d, J = 8.8 Hz, 1H), 4.83 (d, J = 8.8 Hz,
1H), 4.13 (m, 1H), 3.97 (t, J = 7.4 Hz, 2H), 3.81 (s, 3H), 3.54 (s, 3H),
3.52 (s, 3H), 3.51 (m, 1H); 13C NMR (100 MHz, CDCl3) δ 162.9, 159.2,
138.8, 130.7, 130.6, 129.6, 124.3, 121.5, 121.2, 113.8, 113.7, 110.9,
87.3, 81.3, 79.0, 76.6, 73.1, 58.8, 57.9, 55.3; IR ν max 2931, 2833,
1611, 1513, 1463, 1302, 1248, 1174, 1118, 1086, 1031 cm-1; MS (EI, 70 eV)
m/z 368 (M+•, 1), 295 (10), 194 (20), 174 (40), 122 (20), 121 (100); HRMS
M+• calcd for C22H24O5 368.1624, found 368.1622. (Rf = 0.7 in 1:3 v/v
ethyl acetate/hexane).
