$DATUM Molecule 1b (0.37 g, 1.9 mmol), PPh3 (0.55 g, 2.1 mmol), and 17-hydroxy
oleic acid methyl ester [17] (0.72 g, 2.3 mmol), were dissolved in 10 mL
THF. To this mixture was added diisopropyl azodicarboxylate (DIAD, 0.42
g, 2.1 mmol) in 2 mL THF. The reaction was stirred overnight. Solvent was
removed, and column chromatography on silica gel gave 6a. Yield 6a, 805
mg (86%).
