$DATUM General/Typical Procedure: 3.4 General procedure for the preparation of
monofunctionalised pentabromobenzene (2) To an ice-cooled solution of
triphenylphosphine (100 mmol) in dry THF was added
diisopropylazodicarboxylate (Aldrich # 22554-1, 100 mmol). The reaction
mixture was stirred at RT for 10 minutes before alkyl alcohol (100 mmol)
and pentabromophenol (100 mmol) were added. The ice-bath was removed and
the reaction mixture was stirred overnight at RT.
